    "notes": "Pinout, dimensions and ratings: Kingbright SA56-11EWA (0.56 in single digit, common anode, right-hand decimal; spec DSAP8372 rev V.1A), page 1 package drawing and internal circuit (segments a=7, b=6, c=4, d=2, e=1, f=9, g=10, DP=5, common anode on pins 3 and 8) and page 2 ratings (VF 1.9 V typical and 2.3 V maximum at 10 mA, DC IF 30 mA, peak IF 160 mA at 1/10 duty, VR 5 V). It has the same package drawing and pin numbers as the common-cathode SC56-11EWA, with every LED reversed. The two common pins (3 and 8) are one node. Not in the SunFounder kit: project 1.1.4 states the kit display is common cathode. VF and current ratings are for Kingbright's high-efficiency-red chip; other colors differ."
